BOT / MACRO POLICY

A bot or macro is anything that plays your character without you actively
present and paying attention: an auto-combat script, unattended AFK
grinding, or a client script that fights, travels, or loots on its own.

Allowed:
  - Client-side triggers and aliases that react to game text while you
    are at the keyboard (see help trigger)
  - Simple keybinds for commands you type yourself

Not allowed:
  - Unattended botting: leaving a script to fight, travel, or grind
    while you are away from the keyboard
  - Any automation used to gain XP, loot, or currency faster than
    normal play would allow

Staff may approve narrow exceptions case by case; ask first if unsure.
Violations are handled under the three strikes policy.

